SYNTHETIC – 8.1 entry whose data stream is a ZIP archive (stored, not compressed, so the
configured password inside it is readable in the raw bytes) and whose variables include a
PDF and a GIF value. Expected: data kind binary, detected ZIP, sizeBytes, hint, no text; the
variables attachment (PDF) and logo (GIF) kind binary with sizeBytes and detected, no value.

Frames use the fixed nonce 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef; a replay replaces it with the
nonce of its request. Lines without the frame prefix are vendor noise the classifier ignores.
Used by QueueEntryV81ContractTest (tasks.md T026, research D-18, D-19).
